<</AP<</N 882 0 R >>/Border[ 0 0 0]/Contents(Fault Seeding\nCalculating confidence C\n\nC = 1 if n > N and   \nC = S/\(S - N + 1\) if n  < N\n\nWhere\n\nS is the number of seeded faults,\n\nN is the total number of non-seeded \(indigenous\) faults which can be found\n\nWe calculate N by\n\nN = S*n / s \n\nWhere n is actual number of faults detected during testing and s is the number of seeded faults detected during testing.\n\nC = 1 since N=0, n=2 => n > N)/DA( /Helv 12 Tf 0 Tc 13.44 TL 0 0.466667 0.831373 rg )/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Rect[ 98.25 99.75 606 369]/Rotate 0/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
